<title>UK: Banque Paribas sets 2.0 bln Lux franc bond.</title>
<headline>Banque Paribas sets 2.0 bln Lux franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Paribas Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE PARIBAS LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    16.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.00    PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>TAX PROVS  STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	FULL FEES PLUS 0.25 PCT PRAECIPIUM</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
